<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - <%= appName %>
    </title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --secondary: #0f172a;
            --surface: #1e293b;
            --surface-light: #334155;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --danger: #ef4444;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: var(--white);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .brand-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-dark) 100%);
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .brand-icon svg {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .brand-text {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--white) 0%, var(--text-secondary) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            display: block;
        }

        .header-tagline {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--surface-light), transparent);
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--white);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        h2:first-of-type {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        h2 svg {
            color: var(--primary);
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
        }

        .danger-icon {
            color: var(--danger) !important;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        ul {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: var(--white);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .contact-box {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .contact-box p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .contact-box p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .contact-link {
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .contact-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 45px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .card {
                padding: 24px;
            }

            .brand-text {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="brand-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                        d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="brand-text">Privacy Policy</span>
            <p class="header-tagline">Commitment to protecting your privacy</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                        d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                Information Collection and Use
            </h2>
            <p>
                At <span class="highlight">Devansh Sahu</span>, the developer of <span class="highlight">
                    <%= appName %>
                </span>, we are committed to maintaining the trust and confidence of our users. Our privacy policy outlines how we handle your personal information.
            </p>
            <p>
                We may collect certain information to provide and improve our services to you. We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties without your explicit consent, except as described in this policy.
            </p>

            <h2>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                        d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
                </svg>
                Data Protection
            </h2>
            <p>We value your trust in providing us your Personal Information, thus we are striving to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>We use industry-standard security measures to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, modification, or unauthorized destruction of the Data.</li>
                <li>Data processing is carried out using computers and/or IT enabled tools, following organizational procedures and modes strictly related to the purposes indicated.</li>
                <li>We comply with Google Play's policies and guidelines to ensure user data is handled securely.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                        d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                App & Developer Information
            </h2>
            <p>
                This policy is relevant to the Google Play Store application <span class="highlight">
                    <%= appName %>
                </span>, published by the developer <span class="highlight">Devansh Sahu</span>.
            </p>

            <div class="contact-box">
                <h2>
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                            d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                    </svg>
                    Privacy Point of Contact
                </h2>
                <p>
                    If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:devanshsahu7000@gmail.com"
                        class="contact-link">devanshsahu7000@gmail.com</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2024 Devansh Sahu. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
